        <h1 id='case-agilitybandits-logotype-title'>Agility Bandits</h1>
        <p class='case-subtitle'>
          A playful identity built around a real agility dog, with supporting graphics inspired by
          speed, movement, and the chaos of the sport.
        </p>

        <dl class='case-summary' aria-label='Project summary'>
          <div>
            <dt>Role</dt>
            <dd>Brand design and vector illustration</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
